# What Git does not track stays out of the image (.gitignore), and so do local secrets and agent state.
.git
.claude
**/.env
**/.dev.vars
deploy/engine/engine.env
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.svelte-kit
**/.wrangler
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
compiled
.fast-check.log
contracts/python/rezono_contracts/*.py
!contracts/python/rezono_contracts/__init__.py
contracts/python/rezono_contracts/*.schema.json
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
